2025-01-26 19:36:05 - root - INFO - ```sql
SELECT t."reference_name", t."start_position", t."end_position",
       c.value:"CSQ"::VARIANT:"Protein_position"::STRING AS "protein_position",
       c.value:"CSQ"::VARIANT:"Consequence"::STRING AS "consequence"
FROM GNOMAD.GNOMAD."V2_1_1_EXOMES__CHR17" t,
     LATERAL FLATTEN(input => t."call") c
WHERE t."reference_name" = 'chr17'
  AND t."start_position" BETWEEN 43044295 AND 43125483
  AND c.value:"CSQ"::VARIANT:"Consequence"::STRING ILIKE '%missense_variant%'
ORDER BY c.value:"CSQ"::VARIANT:"Protein_position"::NUMBER
LIMIT 100;
```

This query retrieves the start and end positions of variants within the BRCA1 gene region on chromosome 17. It extracts the `protein_position` and `consequence` from the nested `"call"` column, filtering for variants with a consequence type of "missense_variant". The results are ordered by the protein position.
